cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its findings, please cite it. If you cite the
  measurement findings, please also cite the works being evaluated: Liu et al.
  2025 for the StarNet traces and backbone, Xie et al. 2026 for BG-CFQS, and
  Laniewski et al. 2024 for WetLinks.
title: "flwcnx: risk-controlled throughput forecasting for Starlink access links"
abstract: >-
  A reproduction and evaluation study of risk-budgeted throughput forecasting
  for LEO satellite access links. Reproduces StarNet and BG-CFQS, shows the
  latter's risk guarantee is conditional on an exchangeable calibration split
  and that its candidate quantile set imposes a hard floor on the achievable
  risk budget, and evaluates group-conditional online recalibration across four
  datasets.
